  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9f2e8e5b57bd4bd99f33dd56077c2d1, type: 3}
  m_Name: KB_014_DiskFull
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: POSTechSupport::POSTechSupport.Data.KnowledgeArticleSO
  articleId: KB-014
  title: The whole machine is unusable
  category: 3
  content: "When every app is frozen rather than one being broken, look at Windows
    before any device. A full system drive stops the machine writing temp files,
    and nothing that needs to start can start.\nSystem \u25B8 Health shows free space.
    Clear it, then re-read every other app \u2014 while the disk was full they all
    reported Blocked, which means they were never actually diagnosed. There is very
    often a second, real fault waiting underneath."
  relatedErrorCodes: []
  guidanceForIssueIds:
  - P14
